<http://data.silknow.org/object/57887551-32d2-3c9e-b6d7-1a396aedf10c/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Dragon robe of silk tapestry (<i>kesi</i>). Blue ground, on a background of clouds, nine five-clawed dragons pursuing sacred discs. Sky, earth and water, the three sacred mountains, eight Buddhist emblems of good augury. Colours: red, pink, white, blues, and gold thread on dark blue ground. Kesi collar with similar designs on much smaller scale. Cuffs with five-clawed dragons among clouds embroidered in gold thread and blue, green, yellow, pink and white silks on deep blue gauze. Lined with blue silk tissue with a floral pattern."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/57887551-32d2-3c9e-b6d7-1a396aedf10c> .

